%% Sequence Diagram - Transcription
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant CLI as CLI/Streamlit
    participant P as Pipeline
    participant AP as AudioProcessor
    participant D as SpeakerDiarizer
    participant A as ASRTranscriber
    participant S as Summarizer
    participant G as DocumentGenerator

    U->>CLI: Submit audio + metadata
    CLI->>P: process(audio_path, metadata)
    P->>AP: load_audio()
    AP-->>P: waveform, sr
    P->>D: diarize(waveform)
    D-->>P: speaker_segments
    P->>A: transcribe_segments(waveform, segments)
    A-->>P: transcript_segments
    P->>S: summarize(transcript)
    S-->>P: meeting_summary
    P->>G: generate_doc(summary, transcript)
    G-->>P: doc_path
    P-->>CLI: result metadata
    CLI-->>U: download doc
